// SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
//! Hand-built cases of the full social fold ([`fold_view`]) for rules that no normative vector
//! pins yet (the M3 fold reviews' mutation survivors), and regression tests of the review fixes.
//! Each case names its rule; the same inputs are proposed as vectors to the reference model's
//! owner, since the vector files are generated by `testdata/vectors/social-ref` only.
//!
//! | Case | Rule |
//! |---|---|
//! | `recent_discussion_*` | §12.5 order and ties, collapsed posts listed |
//! | `recent_comments_activity_*`, `latest_reply_*` | §12.2 / §12.4 thread activity (placeholders, re-attached comments, `Visible` only) |
//! | `thread_pins_*`, `post_pins_*` | §12.4 thread pins in every comment sort; §12.2 post pins in `magic` only (§20.1 item 18) |
//! | `*_tombstone_*` | §10.2 tombstones through placeholders and for re-attached comments |
//! | `reattached_comment_*` | §2.2 a re-attached comment's lower bound is the root post |
//! | `until_before_1970_*`, `lock_allow_list_*`, `mod_log_*`, `author_*` | §4.3 condition 5, §4.4 `allowed`, §4.12 order and statuses, §4.9 live post |
//! | `k_and_kp_*`, `own_tag_*` | K versus KP: the author gate, the react creator, the wiki tie (K); tag-vote power and own-tag weight (KP) |
//! | `wiki_*`, `tag_votes_*` | §13.2 history tie, duplicate parents, the page cap; §13.3 OP3 before OP4 |
//! | `cid_spellings_*` | §0.4 CIDs compare by canonical form |
//! | `comment_versions_*` | §11 step 6 "on revision n" / "on an unavailable version" |
//! | `digest_*`, `created_before_1970_*` | §1.2 what the digest leaves out; §11 the `[edited]` badge |
//! | `malformed_*`, `reserved_key_*` | §1.1 malformed inputs are rejected; §20.1 item 43 |
//! | `co5_*` | CO5 compares only a valid root (§20.1 item 51) |
//! | `hot_bits_*` | §1.3 rule 3: `libm::pow` bit patterns are pinned |
//!
//! Any namespace build: `cargo test -p lessdugin-core --test social_cases`.

mod social_gen;

